'''Explosion in the Sky (Insane)''' is the first stage in the [[:Category:Cyclone Stages#Advanced Cyclone Stages|Advanced Cyclone Stage]] [[Day of Judgement]]. Beating the stage allows the player to challenge the [[Continuation Stage]] [[Acts of Cat-God (Insane)|Acts of Cat-God]].

