==Battleground==
*3 [[Owlbrow]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*2 [[Mooth]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[White Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[White Cyclone]] spawns after 83.33 seconds<sup>2,500f</sup>.
*1 [[White Cyclone]] spawns after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This is a pretty easy stage if you have any [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Floating Crowd-Controllers]]. If you have cats like [[Bishop Cat (Rare Cat)|Sanzo]], you can just stack them up during the beginning of the stage, and support him with cats like [[Eraser Cat]] and [[Fishman Cat]] to clear the starting enemies. They drop a lot of cash, so feel free to bring any high-cost units that would help in this stage. Just beware of the Continuation stage with [[Divine Cyclone]].
Alternatively, it is possible to use Awakened Bahamut Cat, if paired with another strong rusher like Thunder Jack, to cheese the stage by beating it before the boss spawns. Still, you will need to prepare for the continuation stage as it cannot be cheesed the same way.

==Trivia==
*Explosion in the Sky is a possible reference to the instrumental post-rock band Explosions in the Sky.

